WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.200
In your GlobalHostia account, open Domains.

2
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.850
Then choose the domain you want to update.

3
00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:12.450
Scroll down to DNS records, and open Add a record.

4
00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:13.805
Pick the record type.

5
00:00:13.805 --> 00:00:15.297
Here, it's a TXT record.

6
00:00:15.297 --> 00:00:22.350
Then enter the name, and paste in the value your provider gave you.

7
00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:23.638
Now, click Add record.

8
00:00:23.638 --> 00:00:25.777
It shows up in the list straight away.

9
00:00:25.777 --> 00:00:33.360
And it's usually live within a few minutes.
